
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>WorldGuide</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h2>World<span>Guide</span></h2>
        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#destinations">Destinations</a>
            <a href="#experiences">Experiences</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h1>Discover the world <br> your way.</h1>
        <p>Explore amazing places and create your own journey.</p>

        <form>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Where do you want to go?">
            <button type="button">Explore</button>
        </form>
    </section>

    <section id="destinations">
        <h2>Places waiting for you</h2>

        <div class="cards">
            <div class="card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1597212618440-806262de4f6b?w=400" alt="Marrakech">
                <h3>Marrakech</h3>
                <p>Discover Moroccan culture.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540959733332-eab4deabeeaf?w=400" alt="Tokyo">
                <h3>Tokyo</h3>
                <p>Explore modern Japan.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502602898657-3e91760cbb34?w=400" alt="Paris">
                <h3>Paris</h3>
                <p>Enjoy art and beautiful streets.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    
<div id="reviews">
    <h2>Reviews & Stories</h2>

    <div class="review-card">
  <p><strong>- Amine</strong> (Morocco)</p>
        <p>“WorldGuide helped me discover places I would never have found alone.”</p>
      
    </div>

    <div class="review-card">
   <p><strong>- Sarah</strong> (France)</p>
        <p>“The recommendations made exploring local food much easier.”</p>
     
    </div>

    <div class="review-card"> 
  <p><strong>- Yuki</strong> (Japan)</p>
        <p>“I found a perfect balance between famous places and hidden experiences.”</p>
     
    </div>
</div>
    <footer>
        <h3>WorldGuide</h3>
        <p>Your personal travel guide.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
